      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"scifantasy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/scifantasy/48/2070_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> scifantasy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m a trademark attorney.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>NEAT</p>\n<p>But yeah, Shear Force as a whole is just plain awesome. I would have absolutely loved to have those as a kid. The only thing missing is transforming/combining robots for it to hit every note.</p>",
